Thanks to Emeritus Professor Geoffrey Peter Young Clarke, a mentor and great friend for his encouragement, and many hours of discussion and support. The cover design is from Peter’s notes on how to generate a p-rep (partially-replicated) design by hand in 2010. Peter retired from the Department June 22, 2010!

